    prov:value "[{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"reasoning\", \"content\": \"We have weather: \\\"Lisbon is currently 21\\u202f\\u00b0C with clear skies.\\\" Facts: \\\"Lisbon is the capital of Portugal and lies on the Tagus estuary.\\\" Need to produce a short brief combining these. Possibly add some extra flavor, but keep short. Provide answer.\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"**Lisbon \\u2013 Quick Brief**\\n\\n- **Weather (now):** 21\\u202f\\u00b0C with clear skies.  \\n- **Key facts:**  \\n  - Capital city of Portugal.  \\n  - Situated on the Tagus (Tejo) estuary, giving it a strategic harbor and scenic riverfront.  \\n\\nLisbon enjoys mild, sunny conditions typical of its Mediterranean climate, making it a pleasant destination year\\u2011round.\"}], \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"}]" ;
